KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_Scientist_1::
	.string "Welcome to the EGG MARKET!\n"
	.string "We have a lot of rare\l"
	.string "POKéMON EGGS!\p"
	.string "However, you’ll never know\n"
	.string "what will be hatched from\l"
	.string "the EGGS until the POKéMON\l"
	.string "actually hatched from the EGGS.\p"
	.string "Do you want to pay ¥2,000\n"
	.string "for a mysterious POKéMON EGG?$"

KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_Scientist_2::
	.string "{PLAYER} paid ¥2,000 for an EGG.$"

KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_Scientist_3::
	.string "Please come again!$"

KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_Scientist_4::
	.string "You don’t have enough money.$"

KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_Scientist_5::
	.string "{PLAYER} received an EGG.$"

KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_Scientist_6::
	.string "Please come again!$"

KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_Scientist2::
	.string "We’re collecting POKéMON EGGS\n"
	.string "from the DAY-CARE HOUSE.\p"
	.string "Our boss sells the EGGS\n"
	.string "to those TRAINERS who want\l"
	.string "to try their luck.$"

KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_WorkerF::
	.string "Hi, will you buy an EGG from\n"
	.string "our boss?$"

KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_WorkerF2::
	.string "The EGGS we have are all\n"
	.string "rare ones, I believe they\l"
	.string "will not let you down.$"

KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_Scientist3::
	.string "Selling POKéMON is absolutely\n"
	.string "illegal, but selling EGGS\l"
	.string "is okay, I think.$"

KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_Picnicker::
	.string "I wonder if they’ll be airing\n"
	.string "interviews with tough TRAINERS\l"
	.string "today?$"

KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_BlackBelt::
	.string "This place have became\n"
	.string "a big city, huh?\p"
	.string "Maybe I should go out and\n"
	.string "try that BATTLE TOWER thing...$"

KalmCityNousar_Interior2_Text_Woman3::
	.string "I heard someone sells very\n"
	.string "useful items in this city.$"
